 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Nightstream",
  "excerpt": "Nightstream is a research proving system that combines SuperNeo folding for CCS with HyperNova-style recursion. The active field is the prime field of `2^64 − 59` with a degree-two extension. Ajtai commitments bind witnesses, and the transcripts of the folding scheme and of the step circuits use Poseidon2 only. The Akita commitment scheme (ePrint 2026/1983) compresses the final proof. Akita uses Keccak-family hashes for its own challenges."
 },
